273
00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.275
Kindlasti ka sellepärast, et,

274
00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.870
Mis ta nüüd kannab, aga?

275
00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.300
Mitmete asjaolude kokkulangemisel

276
00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:10.179
Selge see on karm,
kuid õiglane vastus ilmselt ma

277
00:14:10.179 --> 00:14:14.170
